    //
    // Added, all transparent: faceless hexagons on the solids' outlines
    // (sAE, sCF, sKV, sQI), faceless quadrilaterals for the bases AB, CD and
    // for KM, QS (twins of Joyce's filled top faces, which would be raised
    // over the figure if highlighted, #140), and the standing edges AG, HK,
